data: {"type":"tool-input-available","toolCallId":"hcall_6_38461668-901a-4c9c-8fec-29b8bbbaadf0","toolName":"vendo_apps_create","input":{"prompt":"Build a daily checking balance monitor app. \n\nData: call host_listAccounts to get all accounts, then find the checking account (id contains \"checking\").\n\nDisplay:\n- The current checking balance (from accounts data, in dollars)\n- A $2,000 threshold label\n- An alert banner that appears conditionally when the checking balance is below $2,000 (i.e. balance < 200000 cents), showing the current balance and saying it is below the $2,000 threshold\n- When the balance is at or above $2,000, show a green \"OK\" status\n- A MapleSparkline showing recent balance trend bound to the checking account's history\n\nThe alert status must be derived by comparing the live checking account balance directly to 200000 (cents), not from any notification records."},"dynamic":true}

